WEBVTT

00:00:00.895 --> 00:00:07.895
BidKaro: tender discovery, cited requirements and compliance workflow.

00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:15.127
Signing in to a local demo workspace with demo data.

00:00:16.052 --> 00:00:23.052
Dashboard numbers come only from stored records, never from sample metrics.

00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:30.418
Live TinyFish search finds open tenders that match your services, sectors and regions.

00:00:31.942 --> 00:00:39.942
Every tender shows its closing date, the source and why it matched. Expired notices are never listed.

00:00:40.799 --> 00:00:48.799
A tender saved from discovery becomes a workspace with its own documents, checklist and reminders.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:56.130
Overview shows the source, the retrieval time and the sample badge.

00:00:56.408 --> 00:01:03.408
Every requirement keeps its document, page, clause and verbatim excerpt.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:10.730
Documents hold the RFP with page text, printed labels and OCR flags.

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:18.133
Suitability is a deterministic score with every weight and reason shown.

00:01:18.368 --> 00:01:25.368
Eligibility stays separate, and unknown is never a pass.

00:01:25.568 --> 00:01:32.568
Checklist tasks are tender-specific with acceptance criteria and a citation.

00:01:32.995 --> 00:01:39.995
Legal clauses are cited summaries, not legal advice.

00:01:40.205 --> 00:01:47.205
A baseline snapshot lets a later source recheck be diffed.

00:01:47.426 --> 00:01:54.426
Post-award obligations come only from cited performance clauses.

00:01:54.667 --> 00:02:01.667
Reminders come from stored deadlines and tasks. Email needs SMTP.

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:08.901
Three real changes were detected after a TinyFish recheck of a live source.

00:02:10.327 --> 00:02:17.327
Acknowledging stores the human decision and audits it.

00:02:18.635 --> 00:02:25.635
Calendar export is an authenticated ICS file, with no calendar OAuth.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:32.979
Email reminders are opt-in and lead days are configurable.

00:02:33.111 --> 00:02:41.111
Only real TinyFish data and labelled synthetic data. No bid is submitted.
